<article class="env-lemma" id="0BJK">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0BJK">Lemma <span data-tag="0BJK">115.4.14</span>.</a> Let $A \to B$ be a flat local homomorphism of Noetherian local rings. If $A$ and $B/\mathfrak m_ A B$ are Gorenstein, then $B$ is Gorenstein. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Follows immediately from Dualizing Complexes, Lemma <a href="/tag/0BJL" data-tag="0BJL">47.21.9</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>